Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:36.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.72,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:01:00.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:38.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:47.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.72,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.96,0:02:08.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Southern Domain of Allheaven
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.24,0:02:11.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Most planets here are abandoned
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:13.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,with very little spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why strong cultivators aren't willing to set foot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:19.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Instead, it has become a sanctuary for mortals
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and low-level cultivation families.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:21.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.92,0:02:23.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place is secluded enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.20,0:02:25.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still have 20 years before
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:26.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Thunder Celestial Realm opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:29.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,During this time, I have 2 important things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.04,0:02:30.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:33.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to adjust my spells
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.44,0:02:35.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,that don't align with the third step I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.64,0:02:37.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,That way, I won't walk the wrong path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.68,0:02:41.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to gather resentment
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,for the Underworld River.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:48.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn sword intent,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.12,0:02:51.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Xu has finally conquered you !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.72,0:02:52.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am the true Sword Spirit !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:02:58.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you still not letting me out ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:02:57.92,Third,,0,0,0,,Noisy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just you wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.88,0:03:03.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're not done yet !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:08.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The aura of this planet
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:09.40,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1714,553)}Planet Qing Lin\NSouthern Domain\NAllheaven Star System
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.80,0:03:10.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,is similar to Planet Suzaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This planet has many mortals
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.08,0:03:15.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and its strongest cultivator is only Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's not a single Soul Formation cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many cultivation families depend on mortal kingdoms to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.84,0:03:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because the spiritual energy is scarce,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.64,0:03:25.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's difficult for them to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:29.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:42.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.60,0:03:43.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:46.24,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(377,540)}Zhang Yang\NYoung Master of the Zhang Family\NEarly stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:46.24,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1569,540)\fad(300,300)}Zhang Xinhai\NZhang Family Head\NLate stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your father
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,has little time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Zhang Family Head of every generation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,must personally set foot on this peak
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,to gaze upon the heavens and the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:03:59.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and try to understand them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:02.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the ancestral rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.08,0:04:07.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Looking back, I, Zhang Xinhai,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:10.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,have led the Zhang Family for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:12.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Zhang Family
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:16.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,has become the number one family on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:20.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The previous Zhang Family Heads were also diligent
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:23.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,so why
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:25.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't the heavens let us live longer ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was stuck at Late stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.92,0:04:33.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,unable to reach Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.44,0:04:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:37.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:04:59.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to see him
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.48,0:05:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,when I used my Divine Sense earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.68,0:05:03.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I can clearly see him with my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:06.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,What level of cultivation is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:08.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,is not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:11.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.76,0:05:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,that such a peak
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:16.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,is being used by you guys as a graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:35.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Zhang Xinhai pays respects to Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Senior likes this Heng Yun Peak,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.16,0:05:41.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior will offer it to you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:48.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your lifespan is nearly exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:50.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even with my power,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's hard to solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior misunderstood me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.64,0:05:57.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior understands the will of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:59.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would like to have the tremendous opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:04.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,to witness Senior's spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:06.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,That way, I'll die without regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not to mention this peak,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll even gift you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Planet Qing Lin
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,if Senior likes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't defy the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:18.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,to change your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.00,0:06:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I can ignite your remaining spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:23.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,to extend your lifespan
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.64,0:06:24.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,by 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.44,0:06:31.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can barely perform this spell
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,after seeing the third step.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.44,0:06:37.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I had known this option existed back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.56,0:06:40.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wan'er wouldn't be like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:07:00.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Senior, for giving me a second life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:00.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.72,0:07:02.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, what are your instructions ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.32,0:07:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The entire Zhang Family
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:04.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,will do its best
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.92,0:07:06.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,to carry them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I give you 10 years
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:09.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,to gather
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,as much resentment from mortals as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:14.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The more the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:17.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I’m pleased with your result,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.24,0:07:18.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,then
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,as long as I'm on this planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,your Zhang Family
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.24,0:07:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,will never lose its legacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:30.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:32.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,who is this person ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:33.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't ask too much !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.40,0:07:35.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quick,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.12,0:07:35.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's return to the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:37.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mobilize the whole family
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.48,0:07:38.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,no matter the cost
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,to work for Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:41.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Zhang Family's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.24,0:07:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,heaven-sent fortune !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,From today onward,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.76,0:08:09.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,this planet
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:15.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The area 10 000 li from Heng Yun Peak
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.44,0:08:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,is now a restricted area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:18.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Intruders
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:20.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,will not be shown mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.04,0:08:39.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,On this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:43.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I became the ruler of Planet Qing Ling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:45.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The restricted area of Heng Yun:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,10 000 li sealed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:55.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Lasher...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have many artifacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.16,0:08:59.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,In terms of offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,the celestial sword and the half-moon blade are stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:04.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,In terms of defense,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:08.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Billion-Soul Flag and the Mountains and Rivers Painting are sturdier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:09.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,In terms of abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.36,0:09:12.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Celestial Mountain and the God Slaying Chariot are more versatile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this whip
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:18.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the only one that faintly touches upon the third step I glimpsed at.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It subtly aligns with the meaning of karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.28,0:09:24.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,My domain
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.24,0:09:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,has gradually shifted from Life and Death toward Karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:30.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this path is vast
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.12,0:09:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,and with my current comprehension
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.16,0:09:35.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not yet able to materialize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.56,0:09:39.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can probably use this whip to carry my domain
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,and slowly materialize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:48.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Merging my domain and an artifact...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:51.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Dao is within oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.84,0:09:53.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll use this whip as a proxy,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:55.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,to temporarily carry karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.52,0:09:57.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:09:59.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will not betray my Dao.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:22.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\pos(1670,468)}5 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:25.36,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(279,521)\fad(300,300)}Zhang Family Residence\NPlanet Qing Lin
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:24.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Family Head,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.24,0:10:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,70% of the resentment from the West Mountains Region has been gathered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the land is vast
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.32,0:10:29.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,and mortals are scattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.60,0:10:30.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will be difficult to accelerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:32.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The situation on the eastern sea islands is even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although there are numerous islanders,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.48,0:10:34.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,travel time is the issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.84,0:10:35.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,Flying all over the place
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.04,0:10:37.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,takes a lot of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.44,0:10:39.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Faster !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:40.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,You must do it faster !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:42.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Half of the 10 years deadline has passed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.96,0:10:45.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we have gathered less than 40%.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:46.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior's order
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.92,0:10:49.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,will determine the future of our Zhang Family !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.24,0:10:51.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Issue the order,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.76,0:10:52.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,all family members
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.48,0:10:54.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,must spare no cost
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.52,0:10:55.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,and work day and night
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:10:59.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,in order to complete Senior's order !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:00.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.96,0:11:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,A dead end ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.72,0:11:18.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nothing but dead ends !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:19.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:23.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,have stumbled into the Heng Yun restricted area.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.36,0:11:25.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't scare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:31.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's just some mountain fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:35.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't know how
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.96,0:11:37.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Nascent Soul Ancestors from the Li Family of West City
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:39.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,met their end ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.04,0:11:42.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where did this outsider come from ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:45.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who dares to claim Planet Qing Lin ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:47.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Break for me !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:54.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even Nascent Soul Ancestors
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:56.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,were crushed like bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:58.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we, two mortals,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.92,0:12:00.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,won't even fill the gaps in those ghost's teeths...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor, spare us !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We didn't mean to intrude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:18.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:19.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,are not dead ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.52,0:12:21.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ancestor, for sparing our lives !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.04,0:12:23.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ancestor, for sparing our lives !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.36,0:12:24.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your mercy, Ancestor !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:25.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor is kind !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.52,0:12:31.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,After 5 years of refining,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:33.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,the domain started merging.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:35.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using this whip to wield karma
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:38.72,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(285,475)}Karma Whip
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.32,0:12:37.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,is more convenient
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:38.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,than using Divine Sense to control my domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.72,0:12:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It should be twice as strong now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.16,0:12:42.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:45.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still need to test it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:46.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:48.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,stop fiddling with that little broken whip.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.60,0:12:50.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Grandpa Xu
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,now carries ancient sword intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:53.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:58.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You still dare speak to Grandpa Xu like that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.24,0:13:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.60,0:13:02.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,you still haven't grasped the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:05.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not the same Xu Liguo from back then anymore !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:10.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this thing !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:11.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every being in this world
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:14.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,is subject to karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:16.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is no place
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.84,0:13:17.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,without karmic causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.80,0:13:19.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,And karmic effects
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.92,0:13:21.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,are everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:25.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,The karmic effect is also the source of the karmic cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:32.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, have mercy !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:33.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm dissipating !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:34.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm really
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:35.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,going to dissipate !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:39.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You obtained your ancient sword intent
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:41.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,thanks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:44.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The resulting karmic effect
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.20,0:13:47.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,belongs to me as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Xu knows he was wrong !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.68,0:13:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was truly wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.00,0:13:50.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:51.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,if it weren't for Master
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:53.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,refining me into a devil back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,how could I be where I am today ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:56.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, no, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:13:57.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.52,0:14:00.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could I have the fortune to stay by Master's side ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:01.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,That is your karma,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.92,0:14:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:06.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Liguo, you idiot !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:07.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why do you always forget
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:10.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,that the fiend is more of a devil than me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.48,0:14:11.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:13.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, have mercy !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:14.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Xu knows he was wrong !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.24,0:14:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:17.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is not a joke !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:28.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's decently strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:33.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master's skills are unparalleled !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.36,0:14:34.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.36,0:14:37.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Xu was just putting on an act
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:40.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,all so Master could test his spells some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.84,0:14:42.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Xu is loyal to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.76,0:14:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,The heavens are my witness !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:45.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’m completely devoted to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:46.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you're out now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can stay outside for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.60,0:14:50.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Use the 10 000 li around this peak
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:53.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,to comprehend your sword intent on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Freedom...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:14:58.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait...No...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:14:59.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,There must be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.76,0:15:02.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,It must be a test !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.84,0:15:06.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:09.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xu Liguo can't bear to leave you !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only by your side
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,does Little Xu feel at ease !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:18.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:24.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I knew it was a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:26.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trying to outsmart me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whoever causes trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.12,0:15:42.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be confined for a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:48.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master sure has a way with beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.24,0:15:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,The time I spend on Planet Qing Ling
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.12,0:15:54.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,is one of the rare moments of peace
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:57.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,in my cultivation journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.96,0:16:00.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 10 years deadline
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,is coming soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:08.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give this pill to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.24,0:16:10.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he is talented enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:12.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,he may have a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:13.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,to reach Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.48,0:16:15.95,Second,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.48,0:16:15.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:20.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,As the next Family Head, Zhang Yang,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:22.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,took his father's place in serving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:24.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,By my order,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.48,0:16:27.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,he began planting Celestial Ascension Fruits
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:28.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,on planet Qing Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:38.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And after the Underworld River absorbed the resentment,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.44,0:16:41.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,the river's soul started taking shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:54.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Despite my efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.56,0:16:58.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I haven't made progress in refining my spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:02.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a process of trial and error.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.28,0:17:05.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,By contemplating the direction of the third step,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,my domain
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:09.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,unknowingly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.64,0:17:12.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,reached the absolute peak of Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.88,0:18:01.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,20 months after the Life and Death Domain was completed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,my cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:07.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,also reached Peak Late stage Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.08,0:18:09.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1675,505)}Wang Lin's avatar\NPeak Late stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.48,0:18:09.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,1000 years of cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,to complete the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.92,0:18:29.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even Zhuque Zi, who I once had to look up to,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:31.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,is already behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,On this path of cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.12,0:18:37.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've finally reached the end of the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.52,0:18:41.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before the Thunder Celestial Realm opens,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:43.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still have
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:45.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,3 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1697,538)}half a month later
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:53.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Thunder Celestial Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.12,0:18:55.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,requires a Thunder Cauldron to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.52,0:18:59.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I find Shengong Hu, he may give me a cauldron.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:01.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,But that means he'll see how strong I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's too risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.36,0:19:06.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,According to Shengong Hu,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:10.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Thunder Celestial Temple distributes the Thunder Cauldrons
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,based on the strength of each cultivation family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.16,0:19:14.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,About now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:17.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,should be the time when they retrieve their Thunder Cauldrons.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:20.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1713,549)}Planet Sheng Tan\NSouthern Domain\NAllheaven Star System
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.32,0:19:36.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Lord Messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.16,0:19:38.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1634,541)}Zhang Zhen\NZhang Family Ancestor\NIllusory Yin
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.72,0:19:39.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our Sheng Tan Planet is blessed with your presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:41.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We appreciate your guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.88,0:19:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,An Illusory Yin cultivator ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.20,0:19:46.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems Shengong Hu's intelligence was outdated.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.08,0:19:47.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:49.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,returning with the Thunder Cauldrons ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:50.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.92,0:19:53.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Lord Messenger has any instructions,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,please speak freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.64,0:19:56.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need a Thunder Cauldron.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.80,0:20:13.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old man has just been to the Thunder Celestial Temple
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:16.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,where I heard a rumor about a madman
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.08,0:20:18.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,who dared to impersonate a messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.68,0:20:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I thought it was just some nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.44,0:20:23.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,But after seeing you today,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:26.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.16,0:20:30.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,are the impostor !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:21:02.01,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Ask
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.13,0:20:59.93,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1514,677)}Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.05,0:21:02.09,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}the perilous path filled with countless blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.57,0:21:03.21,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1299,685)}Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.73,0:21:08.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Can the mundane world be shattered
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.09,0:21:06.53,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1557,705)\fad(800,000)}Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.29,0:21:09.97,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,000)\pos(1557,705)}Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.53,0:21:08.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}by a child's steadfast heart ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:15.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}If the laws of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.85,0:21:13.41,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(368,638)\fad(800,300)}Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.73,0:21:16.61,Stamp,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1445,688)\fad(800,000)}Soul Transformation
